<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets warrants on China Travel Int'l.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on China Travel Int'l.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong Kong Branch said on Friday it has launched 695 million American style call warrants on shares of China Travel International Investment Hong Kong Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$3.645	 PREMIUM	   18.02 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1135	GEARING	   3.57x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  16.JAN.98	EXER LOT	  20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	SETTLEMENT DATE 14.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$4.05	  LISTING DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
